      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef row_shares(matrix):\n    X = np.array(matrix, dtype=float)\n    return (X / X.sum(axis=1, keepdims=True)).round(3).tolist()\n\nprint(row_shares([[1, 3], [2, 2]]))\n```"
